# k.scenes/shards/things-d: the usual place (sky, ground, water, indoors, on another thing) and the relative size (tiny to huge) of 77 things (the drawable things and the animals of k.animals) whose name starts with "d"; labelled by a language model from the names (named=model), a sample checked against the drawings.
